    50	// real key calls, deep list equality). Verification builds import MPY and
    51	// never see MPY-CONCRETE. The llvm kompile MUST use --main-module MPY-KRUN —
    52	// with plain MPY the concrete legs are silently absent (this was live for a
    53	// while: sorted-key stuck and comprehension asserted wrong under krun).
    54	module MPY-KRUN
